<item>
            <title>[LU-19819] Typo in lfsck_query and others help messages</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19819</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Short help message for lctl lfsck_query is wrong for --wait&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
lctl lfsck_query --help
check the LFSCK global status
usage:
lfsck_query [-M | --device MDT_device] [-h | --help]
&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; [-t | --type check_type[,check_type...]]
&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; [-t | --wait]
options:
-M: device to query LFSCK on
-t: LFSCK type(s) to be queried (&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;default&lt;/span&gt; is all)
-h: &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt; help message
-w: &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;do&lt;/span&gt; not &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; until LFSCK not running
&#160;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There are also issue on output of some help messages:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
usage: --device &amp;lt;mdtname&amp;gt; changelog_register [--help|-h]
  &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;                    &#160;[--mask|-m &amp;lt;[+|-]mask1[&amp;lt;,|+|-&amp;gt;mask2...]&amp;gt;]
  &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;                    &#160;[--nameonly|-n]
  &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;                    &#160;[--user|-u &amp;lt;username&amp;gt;]&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
